Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\pos(649,110)\bord0\c&H000000&\blur0.8\fs32}Deniz Akıntıları
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:43.39,Captions,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(668,567)\p1}m -171 16 l 109 16 109 104 -171 104
